WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.349
Now you race someone. Nine bots, or the ghost of your best ride, and every second

00:00:07.349 --> 00:00:09.180
the board ranks the field.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.836
Each bot rides the pack's pace, easy, medium or hard, with its own drift and swing,

00:00:15.836 --> 00:00:19.722
seeded from the map: the same race rides the same way.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.538
The standings board lists all ten by place, each bot's gap to you in seconds, and

00:00:25.538 --> 00:00:26.985
your row in orange.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:35.644
The power panel reads your place, fifth of ten, with the gaps either side: level

00:00:35.644 --> 00:00:39.157
with the rider ahead, a second clear of the one behind.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:46.452
When places swap, the board reorders at most once a second, and each row slides over

00:00:46.452 --> 00:00:51.110
a hundred and fifty milliseconds. With reduced motion, it simply moves.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:56.571
Race solo, and it's you against your best. With no best ride yet, the ghost rides

00:00:56.571 --> 00:00:59.561
the medium pace, a hundred and ninety watts.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:06.869
The panel reads Ahead or Behind, with the ghost's gap as Best. Level with your ghost

00:01:06.869 --> 00:01:08.108
counts as ahead.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.885
Bots and the ghost run in the browser. With the maps kept on the device, a race

00:01:16.885 --> 00:01:19.232
starts and rides without a network.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.129
From a tablet up, the board sits beside the race. On a phone it steps aside for

00:01:27.129 --> 00:01:28.751
power and the interval.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:37.906
What the tests prove: seven new behaviour specs, the pace, the ranking and the gaps

00:01:37.906 --> 00:01:41.635
in unit tests, all green, and the first bundle unchanged.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:47.840
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:48.185 --> 00:01:52.697
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:52.697 --> 00:01:54.368
every hill and interval.

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:59.891
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:59.891 --> 00:02:05.339
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:05.339 --> 00:02:08.329
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:08.675 --> 00:02:11.167
A custom workout lives under Profile.
